THP enabled(全局) = always [madvise] never
THP defrag        = always defer defer+madvise [madvise] never
2048kB/enabled    = always [inherit] madvise never  (方括号=选中;sysfs 改动要 root,对照全走 madvise)
prctl(PR_GET_THP_DISABLE) = 1

==== 第一幕:出厂状态(WSL2 init 给进程树设了 MMF_DISABLE_THP)====
HUGEPAGE    A 首触写 1 GiB(每页 1 字节):   639.5 ms  AnonHugePages=0 kB
HUGEPAGE    B 全量 memset 1 GiB:               39.7 ms  ( 25788 MiB/s)
    Size:            1048576 kB
    Rss:             1048576 kB
    AnonHugePages:         0 kB
    THPeligible:           0
    VmFlags: rd wr mr mw me ac sd hg 
    (smaps 片段,映射头: 7e0901a00000-7e0941a00000 rw-p 00000000 00:00 0 )
NOHUGEPAGE  A 首触写 1 GiB(每页 1 字节):   287.5 ms  AnonHugePages=0 kB
NOHUGEPAGE  B 全量 memset 1 GiB:               42.2 ms  ( 24238 MiB/s)
  ==> 提示了 HUGEPAGE,大页却是 0:进程级开关压过了 sysfs(详见 e3_thp_probe)

==== 第二幕:prctl(PR_SET_THP_DISABLE, 0) 清掉进程级开关(本内核允许)====
prctl(PR_GET_THP_DISABLE) = 0

